# Le worker WhatsApp persiste sa session dans PostgreSQL/Supabase via whatsmeow/sqlstore.
# Aucun répertoire de session local ne doit être versionné.

# Binaires Go compilés (whatsapp-worker et ses utilitaires cmd/*) — jamais committés,
# reconstruits à chaque déploiement.
whatsapp-worker/worker
whatsapp-worker/worker_linux
whatsapp-worker/cmd/*/*.exe
whatsapp-worker/cmd/*/sendgif
whatsapp-worker/cmd/*/sendtext
whatsapp-worker/cmd/*/sendintro
whatsapp-worker/cmd/*/listgroups
